+# AGENTS.md — Ghostty checkout
+
+Ignored Ghostty/ahterm product checkout. Astrohacker issue and patch policy
+overrides conflicting upstream agent instructions.
+
+Before editing, read `patches/AGENTS.md`,
+`patches/ghostty/AGENTS.md`, and its reconstruction README. Use a branch
+containing `issue-{ISSUE_ID}-exp{N}`. After every intentional commit, archive
+its patch, refresh the Ghostty README, update the manifest if the shipped
+series changes, and record the fork evidence in the current experiment. Never
+commit checkout source or build outputs to the monorepo; the ignored tip alone
+does not ship.
